course: dictionary
lesson: 14654
title: Predecessor: the one who came before
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: A predecessor is the person or thing that came before someone or something else. Look for clues in the word: pre- means before, and the rest comes from a Latin word meaning to go. «Sam is the new captain, and his predecessor was Mia.» Mia was captain before Sam, so she is his predecessor.
explain: Predecessor is often used for jobs and positions, like a king, a head teacher or a captain. It can also mean an older thing that was replaced by something newer, like an old model of a phone. «The new phone is faster than its predecessor.» The old phone came first, and the new one took its place.
explain: Check your meaning by swapping it into the sentence. If Mia was the captain before Sam, then "the person before Sam" fits. In maths, the predecessor of a number is the number just before it, so the predecessor of 10 is 9.
fact: Predecessor means the one who came before someone in a job or position.
fact: «The king's predecessor ruled the land for forty years.»
fact: Pre- at the start of a word often means before, as in preview and prehistoric.
fact: In maths, the predecessor of a number is the number just before it: the predecessor of 10 is 9.
fact: The opposite of predecessor is successor, the one who comes after.
exercise: «Ms Patel became head teacher. Her predecessor had retired in June.» What does predecessor mean here? | The head teacher who came after Ms Patel | A new pupil at the school | *The head teacher who came before Ms Patel | A teacher who teaches maths
exercise: What is the predecessor of 15? | *14 | 5 | 16 | 15
exercise: «The new tablet is lighter than its predecessor.» What does predecessor mean here? | A tablet that has sold out | *The older tablet that came before the new one | The newest tablet of all | A battery for a tablet
test: What is the predecessor of 20? | *19 | 2 | 21 | 22
test: «Ali was the club's new leader, and Jo was the leader before him.» Who is Ali's predecessor? | *Jo | The club | Ali | Nobody
exam: «Priya took over as team captain, and her predecessor is now the coach.» Who is Priya's predecessor? | The coach who joined last week | The youngest player | *The captain before Priya | Nobody, because she is the first
